  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEM Celebrate and Reflective Evaluation of 20 Years of grassroots leadership Tranining in Mynanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The anniversary of 20 years of Grassroots Leadership Training (GLT) provides and important moment to look back and evaluate over the long term the impact of GLT course, its ability to remain relevant to the changing context of Myanmar, and whether it has been able to achieve what it set out to do in 1996. As the GLT&apos;s aim for social transformation is not a quick fix, or highly visible and quantitative process, evaluation to date have had limitations in mapping changes that have taken place, and identifying the contribution of the GLT learning process. At 20 years, this is an opportunity to explore together whether the GLT really is a unique and transformative learning process, and what impacts it has had in how alumni are working in the fields.</narrative>
  </description>
